{"unit_id":"tag:03AU:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。设 <MATH_0002> 为靶固定的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003> 都在 <MATH_0004> 中存在。<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 上同调（cohomology）函子（functors）<MATH_0005>，作为 <MATH_0006>-函子（functor），典范地同构（canonically isomorphic）于函子（functor）\n<MATH_0007> 的右导出函子（derived functors）。此外，存在具有函子性（functorial）的拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）\n<MATH_0008>，其中右边表示导出函子（derived functor）\n<MATH_0009>，它来自左正合（left exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0010>。\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范地同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"具有函子性"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"底层范畴，待批准"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"固定靶的族，待批准"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"Čech 构造的条件，待批准"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"Čech 上同调，待批准"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"上同调函子，待批准"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出函子比较，待批准"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范地同构","context":"函子的典范比较，待批准"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子","context":"右导出函子，待批准"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"具有函子性","context":"拟同构的自然性，待批准"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomor