{"unit_id":"tag:03AU:proof","translation":"注意，阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）的范畴（category）有足够多的内射对象（enough injectives），见《内射对象（Injectives）》命题 <REF_0001>。注意，<MATH_0001> 是左正合（left exact）函子（functor），从阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）的范畴（category）到 <MATH_0002>-模（modules）的范畴（category）。因此导出函子（derived functor）和右导出函子（derived functor）都存在，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》第 <REF_0002> 节。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设 <MATH_0003> 为内射（injective）阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）。这时，函子（functor）<MATH_0004> 在 <MATH_0005> 上正合（exact）。由引理 <REF_0003>，有 <MATH_0006>。由引理 <REF_0004>，<MATH_0007> 在正次数（degrees）处正合（exact）。因此，由上述 Hom 到 <MATH_0008> 的正合性（exactness），可知 <MATH_0009> 对所有 <MATH_0010> 成立。于是 <MATH_0011>-函子（functor）<MATH_0012>（见引理 <REF_0005>）满足《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0006> 的假设，因此是泛（universal）的 <MATH_0013>-函子（functor）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0007>，序列（sequence）<MATH_0014> 也构成泛（universal）的 <MATH_0015>-函子（functor）。由泛（universal）的 <MATH_0016>-函子（functors）的唯一性（uniqueness），见《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0008>，得到 <MATH_0017>。这对大多数应用已足够，建议读者跳过证明的剩余部分。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n设 <MATH_0018> 为任意阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf），定义在 <MATH_0019> 上。在范畴（category）<MATH_0021> 中选取内射（injective）分解（resolution）<MATH_0020>。考虑双复形（double complex）\n<MATH_0022>，其各项（terms）为 <MATH_0023>。接着考虑总（total）复形（complex）\n<MATH_0024>，它关联于这个双复形（double complex），见《同调（Homology）》第 <REF_0009> 节。存在复形（complexes）的映射（map）<MATH_0025>，来自映射（maps）<MATH_0026>；也存在复形（complexes）的映射（map）<MATH_0027>，来自映射（maps）<MATH_0028>。应用《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0010>，这两个映射（maps）都是拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）。具体而言，双复形（double complex）的列在正次数（degrees）处正合（exact），因为 <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 复形（complex）作为函子（functor）是正合的（exact）（引理 <REF_0011>）；双复形（double complex）的行在正次数（degrees）处正合（exact），因为如刚才所见，较高次 <GROUPOPEN_0002><ACCENT_0002><GROUPCLOSE_0002>ech 上同调群（cohomology groups）对内射（injective）预层（presheaves）<MATH_0029> 为零。由于拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）在 <MATH_0030> 中变为可逆的（invertible），这给出该引理最后显示的态射（morphism）。我们略去验证这个态射（morphism）具有函子性（functorial）。\n","allowed_english":["Hom","ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"enough injectives","target_term":"有足够多的内射对象"},{"source_term":"Injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"exactness","target_term":"正合性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"泛"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"泛"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"泛"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形"},{"sou